# ==========================================
# Harmonic Scribe - The Veil of Forgetting
# ==========================================

# 1. The Ghosts of the Machine (Compiled Bytecode)
# We share the logic (.py), never the machine's internal memories of it.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# 2. The Local Workbench (Virtual Environments)
# The isolated universe where your dependencies live. Every scholar 
# must build their own; we do not force ours upon them.
venv/
env/
.venv/
Pipfile.lock

# 3. The Architect's Desk (IDE Settings)
# Your VS Code configurations, window sizes, and local debug paths.
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# 4. The Dust of the Realm (Operating System Debris)
# Hidden files generated by Windows and macOS as you navigate folders.
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# 5. The Spilled Ink (Optional: Generated Outputs)
# If your animation engine eventually saves test frames or videos,
# uncomment these to prevent committing thousands of trial images.
# *.png
# *.mp4
# *.gif